# PWA Icons Directory
# 
# To make the PWA fully functional, add the following icon files:
# - icon-72.png (72x72)
# - icon-96.png (96x96)
# - icon-128.png (128x128)
# - icon-144.png (144x144)
# - icon-152.png (152x152)
# - icon-192.png (192x192)
# - icon-384.png (384x384)
# - icon-512.png (512x512)
# - screenshot1.png (540x720)
#
# You can use a tool like https://realfavicongenerator.net/ to generate these icons
# or create them manually with your preferred design tool.
#
# For now, the PWA will work but may show default icons.
